{"chunk_id": "gold_knowledge_agentteams", "content": "OnCall uses AgentTeams to describe the AIOps incident workflow as a named team of specialist agents. Member maps a stable team role to an ADK agent and the builder compiles it back into Eino ADK resumable workflows.", "content_hash": "ade2eeb52151db661c37032b465d8fcdac6d021151094f2727ce5366060e9acc", "doc_id": "docs/agentteams.md", "id": "gold_knowledge_agentteams", "metadata": {"manual_confirmation": "confirmed from local repository documentation", "source_lines": "1-13,19", "source_path": "docs/agentteams.md"}, "source_type": "knowledge", "updated_at": "2026-08-18T00:00:00Z"}
