{"chunk_id": "gold_knowledge_rag_boundary", "content": "Hybrid RAG V1 separates seed eval, gold eval, offline BM25 inspect, and live smoke. ragctl inspect is offline_bm25_only and live_hybrid_trace=false; it does not invoke query rewrite, embedding retrieval, RRF fusion, reranker, Milvus, or chat service.", "content_hash": "98b8b13d8a11ca0b1d0fdc8c4ea679fc3659bfa8fef56f079f9764084af1d22a", "doc_id": "docs/rag-operational-runbook.md", "id": "gold_knowledge_rag_boundary", "metadata": {"manual_confirmation": "confirmed from local repository documentation", "source_lines": "5-10,23-28,75-82", "source_path": "docs/rag-operational-runbook.md"}, "source_type": "knowledge", "updated_at": "2026-08-18T00:00:00Z"}
